  "partial_coverage": {
    "minimax-m3": "Strong on Bourdieu's symbolic denegation, Rennie/Potts/Tan validator ethnography, Derrida/Bataille structural impossibility argument, and Revue du M.A.U.S.S. tradition. Includes Lipset and 'Controlling Fictions' critiques of dividual concept. Explicit synthesis section with three unresolved tensions.",
    "glm-5.3-flash": "Provides unique quantitative anchor—Macintyre's 625-publication kula bibliography. Strong on emergent-order-without-designer analogy between kula and P2P governance. Maurer HAU essay on hau as Roman nexum is distinctive. Severely truncated—feminist critique, contemporary applications, and conclusion incomplete.",
