    "mimo-v2.5-pro": "Includes Wainberg's feminist critique of Viveiros de Castro (Amerindian perspectivalism); Graeber's 'Moral Grounds' tripartite framework (everyday communism/exchange/hierarchy); specific Giveth DAO ethnography showing reproduction of plutocracy despite anti-hegemonic mission; explicit DAO failure modes ($50M DAO hack). Truncated at synthesis."
  },
  "unique_insights": [
    "minimax-m3: Frames cryptocurrency universal dividend as 'inalienable wealth held collectively but redistributed continuously'—Weiner's framework fits best here; argues Gregory's binary is the 'principal casualty' across all three digital domains",
